 "sentences": [
  "A massive fraud almost killed the Bakerloo.",
  "This London tube railway began in 1893.",
  "Construction stalled until 1898 due to funding struggles.",
  "Then, a financial collapse hit because of Whitaker Wright’s fraud.",
  "In 1902, American financier Charles Yerkes took control.",
  "His company finally raised the funds from foreign investors.",
  "The line opened in 1906, connecting Baker Street to Elephant and Castle."
